      "version": "0.1.3",
      "releasedAt": "2026-10-13T00:57:15.201Z",
      "releaseNotes": "0.1.3：工具目录扩展到 64 个入口，新增离线原生 OCR、图片拼接与 GIF 生成、图表/假数据/开发辅助工具，并增强颜色对比度、JSON、文本、网络与密钥生成能力。0.1.3: Expands the catalog to 64 entries with native offline OCR, image stitching and GIF creation, chart/fake-data/developer utilities, plus improvements to color contrast, JSON, text, networking, and key generation.",
