      "releasedAt": "2026-10-13T05:13:57.024Z",
      "releaseNotes": "0.1.4：空闲端口推荐改为独立探测，一次返回 5 个经系统绑定验证的 TCP/UDP 候选；修复 OCR 模型在发布包中的拉取与完整性校验；优化范围滑块进度、焦点状态及多处主题阴影样式。0.1.4: Makes free-port recommendations independent and returns five TCP/UDP candidates verified by system binding; fixes OCR model hydration and validation during release packaging; improves range-slider progress, focus states, and theme-aware shadow styling.",
