      "version": "0.1.5",
      "releasedAt": "2026-10-21T05:32:56.870Z",
      "releaseNotes": "0.1.5：优化首页搜索、意图示例和多语言支持；改进密钥库布局、筛选、新建与主密码交互，修复用途保存与 XOR 默认用途；OCR 模型改为用户触发的分层按需下载，缩小安装包，并深化多项工具能力。0.1.5: Improves home search, intent examples, and localization; refines vault layout, filtering, key creation, and master-password workflows; fixes usage saving and XOR defaults; moves OCR models to user-triggered tiered downloads to reduce package size and expands tool capabilities.",
